{"title":"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems\">2004 AMC 12A #17</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 24\">2004 AMC 10A #24</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Forward)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Forward)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Backward)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Backward)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> be a function with the following properties:\n</p><p>(i) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/d/b6dd0ff40babd7fbd0c3e3d3b019627c27949616.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" />, and\n</p><p>(ii) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/6518572d741b5a139299a861edf8e5cdc1cffa91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2n) = n \\cdot f(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" /> for any positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/5/0e58c5ce2dbb1847bda4721473fc5581d8584b67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2^{100})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"19\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/3/9636c92dc5d768ae0e6a135ba3d8b32eda1d8609.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf {(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\textbf {(B)}\\ 2^{99} \\qquad \\textbf {(C)}\\ 2^{100} \\qquad \\textbf {(D)}\\ 2^{4950} \\qquad \\textbf {(E)}\\ 2^{9999}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"440\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Forward.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Forward)\">Solution 1 (Forward)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Forward)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From (ii), note that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/d/dada74d2d783d493b6e04cd0402127a7f91a112b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{alignat*}{8} f(2) &amp;= 1\\cdot f(1) &amp;&amp;= 1, \\\\  f\\left(2^2\\right) &amp;= 2\\cdot f(2)  &amp;&amp;= 2, \\\\  f\\left(2^3\\right) &amp;= 2^2\\cdot f\\left(2^2\\right) &amp;&amp;= 2^{2+1}, \\\\ f\\left(2^4\\right) &amp;= 2^3\\cdot f\\left(2^3\\right) &amp;&amp;= 2^{3+2+1}, \\end{alignat*}\" width=\"225\" height=\"103\" />\nand so on.\n</p><p>In general, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/c/73c675d012aa471b132ed2f07e20ce437603c5d9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f\\left(2^n\\right)=2^{(n-1)+(n-2)+(n-3)+\\cdots+3+2+1}\\]\" width=\"277\" height=\"21\" /> for any positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/9/bd923e41635af40a1abe58f230732f2280b0723a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, the answer is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/a/fcad3bde6564daa7188c27f08cceea3e989d842f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} f\\left(2^{100}\\right)&amp;=2^{99+98+97+\\cdots+3+2+1} \\\\ &amp;=2^{99\\cdot100/2} \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf {(D)}\\ 2^{4950}}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"224\" height=\"87\" />\n~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Backward.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Backward)\">Solution 2 (Backward)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Backward)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Applying (ii) repeatedly, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/f/fafab44117cf29ff8331f4e8eb0b8aded149fae4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} f\\left(2^{100}\\right) &amp;= 2^{99} \\cdot f\\left(2^{99}\\right) \\\\ &amp;= 2^{99} \\cdot 2^{98} \\cdot f\\left(2^{98}\\right) \\\\ &amp;= 2^{99} \\cdot 2^{98} \\cdot 2^{97} \\cdot f\\left(2^{97}\\right) \\\\ &amp;= \\cdots \\\\ &amp;= 2^{99} \\cdot 2^{98} \\cdot 2^{97} \\cdots 2^{3} \\cdot 2^{2} \\cdot 2^{1} \\cdot 1 \\cdot f(1) \\\\ &amp;= 2^{99} \\cdot 2^{98} \\cdot 2^{97} \\cdots 2^{3} \\cdot 2^{2} \\cdot 2^{1} \\cdot 1 \\cdot 1 \\\\ &amp;=2^{99 + 98 + 97 + \\cdots + 3 + 2 + 1} \\\\ &amp;=2^{99\\cdot100/2} \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf {(D)}\\ 2^{4950}}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"350\" height=\"253\" />\n~Azjps (Fundamental Logic)\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM (Reconstruction)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/qj5hBxYWalI\">https://youtu.be/qj5hBxYWalI</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A\">2004 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<t